Third-party code inside the vendored bundles

Each file in this directory is an unmodified upstream distribution; VERSIONS
records versions, sources and checksums, and the LICENSE.* files hold each
library's own licence. The force-graph bundle also contains code from other packages.

force-graph.min.js (force-graph 1.51.4, MIT) bundles:
- d3-array, d3-drag, d3-scale, d3-scale-chromatic, d3-selection and d3-zoom
  (ISC), d3-force-3d (MIT)
- kapsule, accessor-fn, index-array-by, float-tooltip and
  canvas-color-tracker (MIT), bezier-js (MIT), lodash-es (MIT),
  @tweenjs/tween.js (MIT)

